<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Oct budget deficit SKK 12.9 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Oct budget deficit SKK 12.9 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's state budget deficit narrowed to 12.9 billion crowns for the January-October period, from 13.4 billion crowns in the first nine months of 1996, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK STATE BUDGET    Jan-Oct  Jan-Sept  Jan-Aug  1996(est)</p>
<p>  Expenditure (SKK bln)  149.2    133.0     114.4    189.425</p>
<p>  Revenues		   136.3    119.6     106.5    162.425</p>
<p>  Balance		    -12.9    -13.4	-7.9    -27.000</p>
<p>Note. The 1996 estimate is based on the government budget plan approved by parliament.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
